            "review_title": "Review at The Sunset Cafe",
            "review_text": "Kanitgrey\nHanoi, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nA Sunset Sensation!\nNov 2018 • Friends\nThe Sunset Cafe is quite literally the best cafe in the world EVER! \n\nWhat more can I say. It combines sensational sunsets, great views at other times of the day, a lovely breeze (a godsend in a hot hole like Hanoi), classic cocktails, crisps craft beers, and jelicious jerky. \n\nI would highly recommend travellers to get away from the tourist riff-raff in the Old Quarter and sample a bit of real Hanoi from one of Sunset's comfortable couches. \n\nThis place really deserves 6 stars, but I guess I will have to settle for 5.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 17, 2018",
            "rating": 4.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
