            "review_title": "Review at The Sunset Cafe",
            "review_text": "Julien P\n19 contributions\n0\nHidden gem\nDec 2017 • Friends\nI love to have coffee there after lunch. Tomas, the owner, is buying it from the oldest coffee roastery in Hanoi. If it's later in the day, I enjoy a fresh Truc Bach or have a taste of some Czech beers!\n \nThe view is stunning whatever the weather! It's super relax and has its regulars. \n\nAs the title mentions, it is a hidden gem, 50 meters after the more known Den. Come and have a look for yourself!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 12, 2017",
